Packetizer (origin/main 81e606a0c): an optional commit gate ahead of the net.

The hit-deadline commit is considered only after the ball has crossed net_x, so a ball that needs less than
0.405 s from the net to the strike plane (anything faster than about 3.5 m/s at the plane) is announced late:
0.22-0.30 s instead of 0.39 s. `commit_gate_x` (ROS parameter of hope_ball_flight_packetizer, default NaN =
unchanged) makes the flight eligible once it is inside that x; the deadline clock, the fit and the packet are
untouched, so every ball that already got its full reserve is committed at the same instant as before.
Applied by tools/gate3/build_main_stack.sh; tools/supergate/commit_gate.py makes the same edit in Supergate.

